# Suppressions for the gitleaks scan.
#
# Format: one fingerprint per line — `<commit-sha>:<file>:<rule>:<line>`.
# Add a comment with the WHY for every entry so future reviewers can audit.
#
# Run `gitleaks detect --verbose` locally to see the fingerprint for a
# finding before adding it here.

